<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     个人学术主页 · Academic Personal Website
     用法：把所有【中括号】里的占位内容替换成你自己的即可。
     头像：把你的照片命名为 avatar.jpg 放在同目录；或改下面 <img> 的 src。
     部署：见文件最底部 DEPLOY  注释，或我给你的聊天说明。
     ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<title>[你的名字] — [研究方向，如 Machine Learning]</title>
<meta name="description" content="[你的名字] 的学术主页 · [职位/院校] · 研究 [方向关键词]">

<!-- Fonts -->
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Crimson+Pro:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400&family=Newsreader:opsz,wght@6..72,400;6..72,500;6..72,600&family=Spectral:wght@500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
  :root{
    --paper:#fbfaf6;        /* 米白底，非纯白 */
    --paper-2:#f4f2ea;
    --ink:#1c1d1f;          /* 近黑墨色正文 */
    --ink-soft:#43474d;
    --ink-faint:#74797f;
    --rule:#e2ddd0;         /* 细分隔线 */
    --rule-strong:#cfc8b6;
    --accent:#143a5a;       /* 深墨蓝学术强调色 */
    --accent-2:#9a6a2f;     /* 暖棕次强调（链接悬停/小标） */
    --tag-bg:#eef0ea;
    --serif:"Crimson Pro", "Spectral", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    --display:"Newsreader", "Crimson Pro", Georgia, serif;
    --maxw:980px;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:84px}
  body{
    background:var(--paper);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:var(--serif);
    font-size:19px;
    line-height:1.66;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
    text-rendering:optimizeLegibility;
  }
  /* subtle paper texture */
  body::before{
    content:"";position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:-1;pointer-events:none;
    background-image:radial-gradient(rgba(20,20,20,.018) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size:3px 3px;
  }
  a{color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none;
    border-bottom:1px solid rgba(20,58,90,.28);
    transition:color .18s, border-color .18s, background .18s;}
  a:hover{color:var(--accent-2);border-color:var(--accent-2)}
  ::selection{background:#dfe7ee;color:var(--accent)}

  /* ===== Nav ===== */
  nav{
    position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;
    background:rgba(251,250,246,.86);
    backdrop-filter:saturate(160%) blur(8px);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .nav-in{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;padding:14px 26px;
    display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:26px;}
  .nav-name{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:600;font-size:20px;letter-spacing:.01em;
    color:var(--ink);white-space:nowrap}
  .nav-name a{border:none;color:var(--ink)}
  .nav-links{margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:22px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .nav-links a{border:none;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:16px;letter-spacing:.02em;
    position:relative;padding-bottom:2px}
  .nav-links a::after{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;bottom:-1px;width:0;height:1.5px;
    background:var(--accent);transition:width .22s ease}
  .nav-links a:hover{color:var(--accent)} .nav-links a:hover::after{width:100%}

  /* ===== Layout ===== */
  main{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;padding:0 26px}
  section{padding:54px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--rule)}
  section:first-of-type{border-top:none}
  .sec-head{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:14px;margin-bottom:30px}
  .sec-num{font-family:var(--display);font-size:15px;color:var(--accent-2);
    font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;letter-spacing:.12em}
  h2{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:600;font-size:27px;letter-spacing:.005em;color:var(--ink)}
  h2 .en{color:var(--ink-faint);font-weight:400;font-size:19px;margin-left:8px;font-style:italic}

  /* ===== Hero / About ===== */
  .hero{padding:62px 0 54px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 220px;gap:48px;align-items:start}
  .hero-text .kicker{font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--accent-2);margin-bottom:14px;font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:600}
  .hero-text h1{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:600;font-size:46px;line-height:1.08;
    letter-spacing:-0.01em;margin-bottom:6px;color:var(--ink)}
  .hero-text .pinyin{font-size:18px;color:var(--ink-faint);font-style:italic;margin-bottom:20px}
  .hero-text .role{font-size:20px;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:22px;line-height:1.5}
  .hero-text .role b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}
  .hero-text .lede{font-size:19px;color:var(--ink-soft);max-width:60ch}
  .hero-text .lede .hl{color:var(--accent);font-weight:500}

  .portrait{position:relative}
  .portrait img{width:220px;height:268px;object-fit:cover;display:block;
    border-radius:3px;filter:grayscale(18%) contrast(1.02);
    box-shadow:0 1px 0 var(--rule-strong), 14px 14px 0 -2px var(--paper-2), 14px 14px 0 -1px var(--rule-strong);}
  .portrait figcaption{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-faint);margin-top:18px;
    font-style:italic;text-align:center;line-height:1.5}

  .links-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px 10px;margin-top:26px}
  .pill{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:15px;color:var(--accent);
    border:1px solid var(--rule-strong);border-radius:2px;padding:5px 12px;background:#fff;
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}
  .pill:hover{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-color:var(--accent)}
  .pill svg{width:14px;height:14px;fill:currentColor}

  /* ===== Research / Interests ===== */
  .interests{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:22px 34px}
  .interest{padding-left:18px;border-left:2px solid var(--rule-strong)}
  .interest h3{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:600;font-size:20px;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:6px}
  .interest p{font-size:17px;color:var(--ink-soft);line-height:1.6}
  .tags{margin-top:28px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}
  .tag{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);background:var(--tag-bg);
    border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:2px;padding:4px 11px;letter-spacing:.01em}

  /* ===== Publications ===== */
  .pub{display:grid;grid-template-columns:64px 1fr;gap:20px;padding:22px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--rule)}
  .pub:first-of-type{border-top:none;padding-top:4px}
  .pub-year{font-family:var(--display);font-size:18px;color:var(--accent-2);
    font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;padding-top:2px}
  .pub-venue-tag{display:inline-block;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.04em;
    color:#fff;background:var(--accent);border-radius:2px;padding:1px 8px;margin-bottom:8px;
    font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:600}
  .pub-venue-tag.alt{background:var(--accent-2)}
  .pub-title{font-size:20px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.35;margin-bottom:5px;
    display:block;border:none}
  a.pub-title:hover{color:var(--accent)}
  .pub-authors{font-size:16.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:5px}
  .pub-authors .me{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600;border-bottom:1.5px solid var(--accent-2)}
  .pub-meta{font-size:16px;color:var(--ink-faint);font-style:italic}
  .pub-links{margin-top:9px;display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .pub-links a{font-size:14px;color:var(--accent);border:1px solid var(--rule-strong);
    border-radius:2px;padding:2px 9px;font-style:normal}
  .pub-links a:hover{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-color:var(--accent)}
  .more-note{font-size:16px;color:var(--ink-faint);font-style:italic;margin-top:24px}

  /* ===== News (optional small) ===== */
  .news{display:grid;grid-template-columns:108px 1fr;gap:8px 18px;font-size:17px}
  .news dt{color:var(--accent-2);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
  .news dd{color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:10px}

  /* ===== CV / Contact ===== */
  .contact-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:40px}
  .contact-block h3{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:600;font-size:19px;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:14px}
  .contact-list{list-style:none}
  .contact-list li{font-size:17px;color:var(--ink-soft);padding:7px 0;display:flex;gap:12px;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule)}
  .contact-list li:last-child{border-bottom:none}
  .contact-list .lab{width:74px;flex:none;color:var(--ink-faint);font-style:italic}
  .contact-list .val{color:var(--ink)}
  .cv-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:6px;
    font-family:var(--display);font-size:18px;font-weight:600;
    background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border:1px solid var(--accent);
    padding:11px 22px;border-radius:2px;letter-spacing:.01em}
  .cv-btn:hover{background:#0d2a43;color:#fff}
  .cv-btn svg{width:17px;height:17px;fill:currentColor}

  /* ===== Footer ===== */
  footer{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;padding:30px 26px 56px;
    border-top:1px solid var(--rule);color:var(--ink-faint);font-size:14.5px;
    display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}
  footer a{color:var(--ink-faint);border:none}
  footer a:hover{color:var(--accent)}

  /* ===== Reveal animation ===== */
  .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px);transition:opacity .7s ease, transform .7s ease}
  .reveal.in{opacity:1;transform:none}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.reveal{opacity:1;transform:none;transition:none}}

  /* ===== Responsive ===== */
  @media (max-width:760px){
    body{font-size:18px}
    .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:34px}
    .portrait{order:-1;width:max-content}
    .portrait img{width:172px;height:210px}
    .hero-text h1{font-size:37px}
    .interests,.contact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .nav-name{font-size:18px}
    .nav-links{gap:16px}
    .nav-links a{font-size:15px}
    .pub{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:6px}
    .pub-year{font-size:16px}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <div class="nav-in">
    <span class="nav-name"><a href="#top">[你的名字]</a></span>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#research">Research</a>
      <a href="#publications">Publications</a>
      <a href="#contact">CV &amp; Contact</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<main id="top">

  <!-- ========== HERO / ABOUT ========== -->
  <header class="hero" id="about">
    <div class="hero-text reveal">
      <div class="kicker">[职位 · 如 PhD Student / Assistant Professor]</div>
      <h1>[你的名字]</h1>
      <div class="pinyin">[拼音或英文名，如 Zhang San · 张三]</div>
      <p class="role">
        [一句身份说明，如：] <b>[院系/实验室]</b>，[大学名]。<br>
        [可加一行：导师 / 团队，如 Advised by Prof. X.]
      </p>
      <p class="lede">
        I work on <span class="hl">[你的研究领域，如 machine learning and computer vision]</span>.
        我的研究聚焦于 [一两句话概括你的研究问题与目标，如：如何让模型在数据稀缺的条件下高效学习与可靠推理]。
        [可补一句愿景或近况。]
      </p>

      <div class="links-row">
        <!-- 把 # 换成你的真实链接；用不到的整条删掉即可 -->
        <a class="pill" href="mailto:[you@email.com]">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M2 4h20v16H2zM2 4l10 8L22 4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/></svg>Email</a>
        <a class="pill" href="[your_cv.pdf]">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 2h9l5 5v15H6z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/></svg>CV</a>
        <a class="pill" href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=[ID]">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2L1 8l11 6 9-4.9V16h2V8z"/></svg>Scholar</a>
        <a class="pill" href="https://github.com/[username]">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 1C5.9 1 1 5.9 1 12c0 4.9 3.2 9 7.6 10.4.6.1.8-.2.8-.5v-2c-3.1.7-3.8-1.3-3.8-1.3-.5-1.3-1.3-1.7-1.3-1.7-1-.7.1-.7.1-.7 1.1.1 1.7 1.2 1.7 1.2 1 1.7 2.6 1.2 3.2.9.1-.7.4-1.2.7-1.5-2.5-.3-5.1-1.2-5.1-5.5 0-1.2.4-2.2 1.1-3-.1-.3-.5-1.4.1-2.9 0 0 .9-.3 3 1.1.9-.2 1.8-.4 2.7-.4.9 0 1.8.1 2.7.4 2.1-1.4 3-1.1 3-1.1.6 1.5.2 2.6.1 2.9.7.8 1.1 1.8 1.1 3 0 4.3-2.6 5.2-5.1 5.5.4.3.8 1 .8 2.1v3.1c0 .3.2.6.8.5C19.8 21 23 16.9 23 12c0-6.1-4.9-11-11-11z"/></svg>GitHub</a>
        <a class="pill" href="https://twitter.com/[handle]">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M18 3h3l-7 8 8 10h-6l-5-6-5 6H3l8-9L3 3h6l4 5z"/></svg>Twitter / X</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <figure class="portrait reveal">
      <!-- 把你的照片命名 avatar.jpg 放到同目录；没有照片时下面会显示一个占位灰块 -->
      <img src="avatar.jpg" alt="[你的名字]"
           onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22 width=%22220%22 height=%22268%22&gt;&lt;rect width=%22100%25%22 height=%22100%25%22 fill=%22%23e9e6dc%22/&gt;&lt;text x=%2250%25%22 y=%2250%25%22 font-family=%22Georgia%22 font-size=%2216%22 fill=%22%23a39c89%22 text-anchor=%22middle%22 dominant-baseline=%22middle%22&gt;avatar.jpg&lt;/text&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;';">
      <figcaption>[一句简短说明<br>如所在城市 / 年份]</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </header>

  <!-- ========== RESEARCH ========== -->
  <section id="research">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <span class="sec-num">01</span>
      <h2>研究方向 <span class="en">Research</span></h2>
    </div>

    <div class="interests reveal">
      <div class="interest">
        <h3>[方向一，如 Representation Learning]</h3>
        <p>[一两句话：这个方向你关心什么问题、用什么方法、想达到什么。]</p>
      </div>
      <div class="interest">
        <h3>[方向二]</h3>
        <p>[一两句话说明。]</p>
      </div>
      <div class="interest">
        <h3>[方向三]</h3>
        <p>[一两句话说明。]</p>
      </div>
      <div class="interest">
        <h3>[方向四]</h3>
        <p>[一两句话说明。]</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="tags reveal">
      <!-- 关键词标签，按需增删 -->
      <span class="tag">Machine Learning</span>
      <span class="tag">Deep Learning</span>
      <span class="tag">Computer Vision</span>
      <span class="tag">[关键词]</span>
      <span class="tag">[关键词]</span>
      <span class="tag">[关键词]</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ========== PUBLICATIONS ========== -->
  <section id="publications">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <span class="sec-num">02</span>
      <h2>论文 <span class="en">Publications</span></h2>
    </div>

    <!-- 复制 .pub 整块即可新增一篇；作者列表里你自己的名字用 <span class="me">…</span> 包住 -->
    <article class="pub reveal">
      <div class="pub-year">2025</div>
      <div>
        <span class="pub-venue-tag">NeurIPS 2025</span>
        <a class="pub-title" href="#">[论文标题：A Clear and Descriptive Title of the Work]</a>
        <div class="pub-authors"><span class="me">[你的名字]</span>, Co-Author A, Co-Author B</div>
        <div class="pub-meta">Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems (NeurIPS), 2025.</div>
        <div class="pub-links">
          <a href="#">PDF</a><a href="#">arXiv</a><a href="#">Code</a><a href="#">BibTeX</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="pub reveal">
      <div class="pub-year">2024</div>
      <div>
        <span class="pub-venue-tag alt">CVPR 2024</span>
        <a class="pub-title" href="#">[另一篇论文标题]</a>
        <div class="pub-authors">Co-Author A, <span class="me">[你的名字]</span>, Co-Author C</div>
        <div class="pub-meta">IEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR), 2024.</div>
        <div class="pub-links">
          <a href="#">PDF</a><a href="#">arXiv</a><a href="#">Project Page</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="pub reveal">
      <div class="pub-year">2023</div>
      <div>
        <span class="pub-venue-tag">Journal</span>
        <a class="pub-title" href="#">[期刊论文标题]</a>
        <div class="pub-authors"><span class="me">[你的名字]</span>, Co-Author D</div>
        <div class="pub-meta">Journal Name, vol. XX, no. X, 2023.</div>
        <div class="pub-links"><a href="#">PDF</a><a href="#">DOI</a></div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <p class="more-note">完整列表见我的 <a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=[ID]">Google Scholar</a>。（* 表示共同一作）</p>
  </section>

  <!-- ========== CV & CONTACT ========== -->
  <section id="contact">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <span class="sec-num">03</span>
      <h2>简历与联系 <span class="en">CV &amp; Contact</span></h2>
    </div>

    <div class="contact-grid reveal">
      <div class="contact-block">
        <h3>联系方式 / Contact</h3>
        <ul class="contact-list">
          <li><span class="lab">Email</span><span class="val">[you@email.com]</span></li>
          <li><span class="lab">Office</span><span class="val">[办公室/楼号，如 Room 301, CS Building]</span></li>
          <li><span class="lab">Address</span><span class="val">[院系，大学，城市]</span></li>
        </ul>
        <a class="cv-btn" href="[your_cv.pdf]">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3v12m0 0l-4-4m4 4l4-4M5 21h14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/></svg>
          下载 CV (PDF)
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="contact-block">
        <h3>近况 / News</h3>
        <dl class="news">
          <dt>2025.09</dt><dd>[一条近况，如：论文被 NeurIPS 2025 接收。]</dd>
          <dt>2025.06</dt><dd>[一条近况，如：在 XX 实验室开始暑期实习。]</dd>
          <dt>2024.11</dt><dd>[一条近况。]</dd>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>

<footer>
  <span>© <span id="yr"></span> [你的名字]</span>
  <span>Built with HTML &amp; hosted on GitHub Pages. <a href="#top">Back to top ↑</a></span>
</footer>

<script>
  // 年份自动更新
  document.getElementById('yr').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();

  // 滚动淡入
  const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries)=>{
    entries.forEach(e=>{ if(e.isIntersecting){ e.target.classList.add('in'); io.unobserve(e.target); } });
  }, {threshold:0.12, rootMargin:'0px 0px -40px 0px'});
  document.querySelectorAll('.reveal').forEach((el,i)=>{
    el.style.transitionDelay = (i % 4 * 60) + 'ms';
    io.observe(el);
  });
</script>

<!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  DEPLOY · 部署到 GitHub Pages（两种方式，任选其一）

  方式 A（最简单，用户主页 username.github.io）:
    1. 在 GitHub 新建一个仓库，名字必须是  你的用户名.github.io
       （例如用户名是 alice，仓库名就是 alice.github.io）
    2. 把本文件改名为 index.html，连同 avatar.jpg、your_cv.pdf 一起上传到仓库根目录
    3. 等一两分钟，访问 https://你的用户名.github.io 即可

  方式 B（项目页，任意仓库）:
    1. 把 index.html 等文件传到某个仓库（如 homepage）
    2. 仓库 Settings → Pages → Source 选 "Deploy from a branch"，分支选 main、目录选 /(root)
    3. 访问 https://你的用户名.github.io/仓库名/

  小贴士：
    · 头像放同目录并命名 avatar.jpg；简历 PDF 命名 your_cv.pdf（或自行改链接）
    · 想换强调色：改最上面 :root 里的 --accent
    · 想加导航项/版块：复制对应 <section> 块即可
═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
</body>
</html>
